{title: Tu Mileya}
{artist: Darshal Raval}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Mainu [D] Rab Mileya, Sab Mileya,        Jab [Bm] Tu Mileya Mainu
[G] Mainu Haj Mileya, Raz Raz Mileya,        Mainu [A] Jab Mileya Hai Tu
[D] Tera Hona Ek Sapna Lagda,        [D] Bas Ik Tu He Apna Lagda
[G] Tere Bina Hun Nai Jee,        Lagna [A] Ve
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
(Tu hi tu tu hi tu hai),        [D] [Bm] [D] [A]
[D] Raat Da Hanera Main,        [Bm] Tu Hi Chan Mera Hai
[G] Dekh Kitna Sohna Rab Ne,        [A] Saath Likh Diya Hai
Aab Ye Khaab [D] Toote Na,        Saath Ab Ye [Bm] Chhoote Na
[G] Kashke Tu Thaam Lena [A] Piya,        [D] Harsa Tere Na Me Kardu
[Bm] Gham Saare Tere Khudme He Bhar Lu,        [G] Rehna Bas Mere [A] Rubaroo
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
Oh [D] Sohneya, Mere [Bm] Sohneya,        Mainu Nai [G] Jeena Tere [A] Bina
